=== task: predict easy
title: Ties and negatives
code:
```python
def best_window_at(nums, k):
    total = 0
    best = None
    best_start = -1
    for right in range(len(nums)):
        total += nums[right]
        if right >= k:
            total -= nums[right - k]
        if right >= k - 1:
