solution:
```python
def min_recolors(blocks, k):
    whites = 0
    best = None
    for right in range(len(blocks)):
        if blocks[right] == "W":
            whites += 1
        if right >= k and blocks[right - k] == "W":
            whites -= 1
        if right >= k - 1:
            if best is None or whites < best:
                best = whites
    return best
```
